WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:24.580
I can see the world though, in the future,
where I'm not missing out on those opportunities.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.400
So that's my vision for this world.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:34.280
My vision is to be able to have incidental
learning experiences.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:38.589
The point is and the key is access.

00:00:38.589 --> 00:00:40.400
For everyone here today.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:46.430
So this is a deaf instructor who is in our
College of Liberal Arts.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:48.150
He's teaching psychology.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:55.930
He's teaching a course here on the neurobiology
of schizophrenia.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.580
And what we'll do during the question session
at the end of the talk,

00:00:58.580 --> 00:01:03.300
I would ask that you ask your questions through
your device.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:07.640
So that what happens is in the question mode
it will actually show who is asking the question.

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.960
And show a transcript of your question on
the screen.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:18.360
We learned a lot about the classroom experience
and the learning experience.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:22.180
In college, social life is very important
as well.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:32.370
Do you have studies that show that technology
can promote in terms of the deaf and hearing

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:37.000
students
talking with each other or communicating with

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:38.150
each other?

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:43.680
If you mean communicating through technology,
it hasn't been done yet.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:48.420
I just wrote about it in a chapter that just
went to press.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.100
One of the issues for deaf kids, even the
ones who are now using spoken language and

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:55.720
implants
is that, in elementary school there aren't

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.270
too many issues
except that the deaf kids who have the best

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:04.420
hearing and speech
are the ones most accepted by the hearing

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:04.920
kids.

